" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;startArrow=ERzeroToOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=0;endFill=0;startSize=12;endSize=12;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="AST-orders-r0" target="AST-stock_transactions-r5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1965" y="734.0"/><mxPoint x="1965" y="514.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="AST-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• FKs marked → users reference users.user_id (Login &amp;amp; Users page); not drawn to keep the diagram readable&lt;br&gt;• asset_tag UNIQUE, IDs AUTOINCREMENT, never reused (BR-01) · nothing is deleted: DELETE triggers on items, consumables, loans, borrowers (BR-02)&lt;br&gt;• One OPEN loan per item: UNIQUE index on loans(item_id) WHERE status = &#x27;OPEN&#x27; · only ASSET items with status AVAILABLE can be lent (BR-07, BR-11)&lt;br&gt;• CLOSED loan needs return_date, condition_in, received_by · retired items are read-only (trigger)&lt;br&gt;• stock_transactions and item_incidents are append-only · each stock row updates quantity_on_hand; it can never go below 0 (BR-11)&lt;br&gt;• Overdue is not stored: status = &#x27;OPEN&#x27; AND due_date &amp;lt; today · low stock is not stored: quantity_on_hand &amp;lt; reorder_threshold" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1370" width="1900" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="USR" name="Login &amp; Users (USR) – ER Diagram"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2010" pageHeight="980" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="USR-title" value="Login &amp; Users (U